00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:38.411
You know,

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:39.679
their argument is going to be

00:04:39.679 --> 00:04:41.314
the Trump team's that this is free speech

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:41.948
