00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:44.317
And funny Willis, his argument

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:46.452
is that individual actions

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:47.954
don't have to be criminal on their own,

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.522
but part of a broader conspiracy,

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:50.823
which is what she's charged,

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:51.724
they are

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:53.860
it is why Trump's aides and lawyers

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.928
over a very long period of time

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:57.163
wanted him to stop tweeting

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:57.897
the way he did

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:00.166
and would like him to do less

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:01.834
social posting the way he is now.

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:02.902
It just doesn't get heard

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:03.603
the way it used to.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:03.870
Yeah.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:04.871
And he's but he's announcing

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:06.372
you've got this huge press conference

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:07.840
