when it comes to his wall license

00:07:19.238 --> 00:07:20.506
and the comments he made in Georgia.

00:07:20.506 --> 00:07:21.774
One of the ironies

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:23.276
right now in the situation around

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:24.310
Donald Trump is you will hear

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.111
some of his advisers

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:26.679
say he's really upset

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:27.880
that Rudy got indicted

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:28.915
or leading into this,

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:30.550
he was really worried about Rudy,

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.350
but not so worried

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:31.851
that he was going to pay

00:07:31.851 --> 00:07:32.852
Giuliani's legal bills.

00:07:32.852 --> 00:07:34.153
And this has been an issue over

00:07:34.153 --> 00:07:35.188
and over and over again.

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:35.588
And people

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:37.223
who are still close to Giuliani

00:07:37.223 --> 00:07:38.558
will try to blame

00:07:38.558 --> 00:07:39.959
the Republican National Committee

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:41.961
or this former aide to Trump

00:07:41.961 --> 00:07:43.429
or this person.

00:07:43.429 --> 00:07:44.764
This is Trump.

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:45.798
According to my reporting,

00:07:45.798 --> 00:07:46.466
it was Trump

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.034
who didn't want Giuliani paid

00:07:48.034 --> 00:07:49.502
unless Giuliani delivered

00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:50.770
on his promises.

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.004
And obviously, that didn't happen.

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:53.673
Maggie

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:56.375
Haberman, it's never going to end well.

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.010
Something will

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.111
everything will end eventually.

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:00.713
But but this this part not right now.

00:08:00.713 --> 00:08:01.781
On that lighthearted note,

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:03.349
thank you so much, Maggie.

